{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're about to enter your classroom, but suddenly you got teleported into</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ANOTHER WORLD!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A little witch just summoned you. She said she supposed to summon a cute little dragon. But you show up instead. She looks dissapointed. Even so, she will took responsible and find way to return you back to your world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">finally your journey to become a legendary hero has be-...... Ahem! Unfortunately, you can't use magic and end up being an E Rank adventure guild member,.... for living.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Guild Master said there is abandoned farm  but they can't give you for free, you need to work, that's why you become an adventurer. For now, he allow you to stay at inn for free. atleast for weeks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878180/extras/9d0e5a8f34d838bcd7a8e6fbbc608a40.poster.avif?t=1753877832\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3878180/extras/9d0e5a8f34d838bcd7a8e6fbbc608a40.webm?t=1753877832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[ - ] Unlock farm yard to become a farmer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[ - ] Fishing, Cooking, Mining, Crafting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[ - ] Complete quests from Adventure Guild to increase your Adventure Rank</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[ - ] Become friends with the villagers and you might find something good in return</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[ - ] Enjoy variate seasons and festivals</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">[ - ] There are bachelorette and bachelor you can approach</p><p class=\"bb_para